      "content": "but what \"resilience\" is there in losing it all? there's no comeback from this. the shame is what kills me. every time i think about facing them, about looking them in the eye after i've destroyed our lives... it just feels like it's better if i just weren't here to deal with it. it would be easier for everyone if the problem just went away. like, if i wasn't even around to cause the mess anymore. it feels like the only way to actually stop the bleeding is to just end it all here.",
